数もか?)と変数本体をhoverすると思うんで、引数でその辺うまくハンドリングできてればいいのかな....と","ts":"1633079910.055700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"yDl"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bf340b91-352f-4868-9dd3-8f78c80197a4","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"まー、インラインじゃなくてポップアップで(Vimなら)いいかなあという気がしますね","ts":"1633079805.054900","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":3,"users":["UL6CFN8NR","U9S4G0LJW","U02GD5GRJ72"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"fZkv"}]},{"client_msg_id":"72509a60-7361-4846-b413-32a07fc233e3","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"おあつらえ向きみたいにeasymotion作るのに向いてる機能","ts":"1633079772.054000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"WgE"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f161bced-6bb7-4e09-9e47-30357f3dae20","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"matchaddで隠せるの、coc-smartfが思い切り使ってますね","ts":"1633079738.052500","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["U8R597E9H"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4WjhQ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ce6f1029-4fc7-4ef3-a887-aaaed7c4fbf2","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"個人的にはカーソル乗ったら仮引数名がでてくる、とかでいいなぁ。","ts":"1633079706.051300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ZNs"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3652f682-b6ce-49b0-aba0-54c0cda80a02","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"`matchadd` でも隠せるの知らなかったな。なにかに使えそう…","ts":"1633079668.050300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8bKa"}]},{"type":"message","user":"UPZHKAM7W","text":"```\nconceal                                         *conceal* *:syn-conceal*\n{訳注: conceal = 隠す、秘密にする}\n \n\"conceal\" 引数が指定されると、そのアイテムは Conceal 可能になる。アイテムが実\n際に Conceal 表示されるかどうかは 'conceallevel' オプションの設定に依存する。\n現在行のアイテムを Conceal 表示するかどうかは 'concealcursor' オプションで制御\nできる (行の編集を妨げないようにするため)。\nもう一つの方法として|matchadd()|を用いても、テキストを隠すことができる。\n```","ts":"1633079600.049700","bot_id":"BPM858KEE","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"a67bb5e8-5ccb-40a7-8d6a-cd1e81da9569","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":":h conceal","ts":"1633079598.049600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"fGo"}]},{"client_msg_id":"47a24c4a-4e96-4764-b605-e043349b27dd","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"バッファ上のテキストを仮想的に差し替えられる仕組みがVimに増えればいいという意味で、つまり難易度です","ts":"1633079596.049300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"6mQ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"55465e19-dd29-4d39-8e49-5eb231ac6577","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"Concealをそのまま使うのではなく、その仕組みを流用するイメージです","ts":"1633079550.047500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"G8F"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bccdb508-50b2-4dd5-99c3-918e6f421834","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"勘違いかもしれません。。。","ts":"1633079524.046900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ds="}]},{"client_msg_id":"c88d4666-d00d-45e9-840b-6b5f03ef4244","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"減らすだけか","ts":"1633079504.046000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"55ehN"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1185a5de-cf44-4d22-95d8-d5179d28074a","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"あー、そうなのか","ts":"1633079493.045700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"vacta"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e1a576f5-8a5c-4df9-a773-9d35711cdef1","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"コンシールは文字を増やす方向には働けなかった気がします","t